flowchart TD
  A[Customer raises return request in app] --> B{Within 7 days of delivery?}
  B -->|No| R1([Auto-rejected by app])
  B -->|Yes| C[Assign courier for pickup]
  C --> P{Pickup successful?}
  P -->|No, fewer than 3 attempts| C
  P -->|No, 3rd failed attempt| X([Request cancelled])
  P -->|Yes| W[Item reaches warehouse]
  W --> Q{Passes quality check?}
  Q -->|No| RJ[Return rejected]
  RJ --> S([Item shipped back to customer])
  Q -->|Yes| M{Payment method?}
  M -->|UPI| U([Instant refund to UPI])
  M -->|Card| K([Refund to card in 5-7 days])
